{
  "$schema_version": 1,
  "_doc": "Test VIs and behaviour runs for <skill>/ops/run-checks.md (entry format there). A test VI reports a named Pass Boolean and error out (convention: hygiene.test-convention). Paths relative to the product folder (the parent of .labview/), forward slashes. Optional per test: kind (vi | caraya | lunit), read_only (indicators to read; the rest stay off the read-back), returns (true when checked offline that the VI returns without a panel press). The checks are those of requirements/03-acceptance.md, sections 1 and 2.",
